+## OpenGamepadUI does not use InputPlumber's intercept mode. While it has focus every gamepad gets
+## FOCUS_PROFILE, which sends each input to DBus as the UI action the intercept used to produce and
+## lets none reach the game behind it. While a game has focus the game's profile is loaded instead,
+## and it has to carry OpenGamepadUI's Guide handling itself (see _with_guide_layer).
+const FOCUS_PROFILE_SOURCE := "res://assets/gamepad/profiles/ogui_focus.json"
+const FOCUS_PROFILE := "user://data/gamepad/profiles/ogui_focus.json"
+## A launcher may declare the profile of the game it runs here: the profile's path on the first
+## line, the pid that owns the declaration on the second. A pid that no longer runs (a launcher that
+## died) voids it. Used when the game has no gamepad profile of its own in the settings.
+var _declared_profile := "/".join([OS.get_environment("XDG_RUNTIME_DIR"), "opengamepadui", "game_profile"])
+var _ogui_focused := true
+
 # Connect to Gamescope signals
